A landmark collaboration begins! ✨
#BhushanKumar’s T-Series present an ambitious Pan-India film starring Mega Powerstar #RamCharan, directed by #Sukumar and produced by #NaveenYerneni and #YRaviShankar of #MythriMovieMakers. #ShivChanana. The film’s journey officially commenced today with a grand Muhurat ceremony in Hyderabad, graced by Megastar #Chiranjeevi as the Special Guest of Honour. 🙏🏼

